er: drag to approximately **55**\n   - Potassium slider: drag to approximately **50**\n   - Soil pH: select **6.5–7.0** (neutral)\n3. Click the **\"Get Crop Recommendations\"** (amber) button.\n4. Take a screenshot of the results dashboard showing:\n   - The Recharts RadarChart (soil nutrients radar) — confirm it renders with colored lines/areas, not blank\n   - The top 3–4 ranked crop cards with match % badges, crop images, and yield info\n5. Verify all crop card images are actual photos (not broken image icons with an X).\n\n---\n\n## TASK 3: Farming Plan Modal\n\n1. On the results from Task 2, click **\"View Farming Plan\"** (or \"View Complete Farming Plan\") on the top-ranked crop card.\n2. Take a screenshot of the modal/drawer that opens — confirm it shows:\n   - A multi-phase cultivation timeline\n   - Fertilizer schedule\n   - Pest/disease alerts section\n3. Close the modal.\n\n---\n\n## TASK 4: Chart & Weather Widget Verification\n\n1. Scroll back up to the Hero section.\n2. Take a screenshot of the **Regional Weather Widget** — confirm the Recharts AreaChart (7-day temperature/rainfall trend) is rendering with visible chart lines and not blank.\n3. Try changing the **Location/District selector** to a different region (e.g., Jorhat or Nashik) and confirm the weather data updates.\n\n---\n\n## TASK 5: Seasonal Calendar\n\n1. Scroll to the **Seasonal Farming Calendar** section.\n2. Click the **\"Kharif (Monsoon)\"** tab filter — confirm the month cards update.\n3. Click the **\"Rabi (Winter)\"** tab — confirm different cards show.\n4. Take a screenshot.\n\n---\n\n## TASK 6: Console Error Check\n\n1. Open browser DevTools console (if possible) and check for any red errors. Report any errors found.\n\n---\n\n## REPORTING\n\nAfter completing all tasks, please provide:\n- A summary of pass/fail for each task\n- Note any broken images, blank charts, or layout issues\n- List the final screenshot paths for each major step\n- Any console errors or warnings observed\n