{"step_index":46,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-21T06:41:59Z","model":"gemini-3.8-flash-tiered","input_tokens":21420,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1961,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe initial parameters define an alluvial soil suitable for Rabi crops with canal/well irrigation and specific nutrient and pH levels. The system should present a radar chart of soil nutrients alongside ranked crop recommendations with match percentages and yield data. Need to verify that the displayed water availability setting is \"Canal\" and that crop card images are not broken.\nA screenshot that clearly shows the crop cards and the radar chart, ideally where \"Canal\" irrigation is active. Then, I need to verify which water availability option is active to ensure \"Canal\" is selected. After confirming this, a screenshot with the top crop recommendations and radar chart is needed.\n\n\nEnsuring \"Canal\" water availability is selected, the page is scrolled to display both the radar chart and crop recommendations. A screenshot captures this combined view for task completion. The \"View Complete Farming Plan\" button on the Wheat card is clicked, and a modal containing the farming plan details is expected. A screenshot of this modal, displaying the multi-phase timeline and relevant information, is then captured.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"webview_browser","args":{"intention":"Select Canal irrigation, capture Task 2 crop recommendation cards and radar chart, click View Farming Plan for Wheat, and capture Task 3 modal screenshot","observation":"Crop recommender inputs set to Humid Subtropical, Alluvial, Rabi, N=110, P=55, K=50, pH=6.8. Radar chart renders with colored area and Wheat is top match at 98%. Proceeding to verify Canal irrigation, capture Task 2 cards, and test Task 3 Farming Plan modal.","script":"// 1. Ensure Canal is selected\nconst canalBtn = page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Canal', exact: true });\nif (await canalBtn.isVisible()) {\n  await canalBtn.click();\n}\n\n// 2. Scroll to crop cards and radar chart\nconst cropCardsHeader = page.getByRole('heading', { name: 'Top Ranked Crop Recommendations' });\nawait cropCardsHeader.scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\n\n// Capture Task 2 results screenshot\nawait page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/Users/abasu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8280cdb4-257b-4bb7-95c6-bfaa06859e23/browser_sandbox/screenshots/task2_crop_recommender.png' });\n\n// Verify crop images\nconst images = await page.locator('img').all();\nconst imgStatus = [];\nfor (const img of images) {\n  const alt = await img.getAttribute('alt') || '';\n  const src = await img.getAttribute('src') || '';\n  const visible = await img.isVisible();\n  imgStatus.push({ alt, src, visible });\n}\n\n// 3. Click View Complete Farming Plan on top crop (Wheat)\nconst viewPlanBtn = page.getByRole('button', { name: 'View Complete Farming Plan' }).first();\nawait viewPlanBtn.click();\n\n// Wait for modal\nconst modal = page.locator('[role=\"dialog\"]').or(page.locator('.fixed.inset-0'));\nawait modal.first().waitFor({ state: 'visible', timeout: 5000 });\n\n// Capture Task 3 modal screenshot\nawait page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/Users/abasu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8280cdb4-257b-4bb7-95c6-bfaa06859e23/browser_sandbox/screenshots/task3_farming_plan_modal.png' });\n\n// Check modal contents\nconst modalText = await modal.first().innerText();\nconst hasTimeline = modalText.includes('Phase') || modalText.includes('Sowing') || modalText.includes('Timeline') || modalText.includes('Preparation');\nconst hasFertilizer = modalText.includes('Fertilizer') || modalText.includes('Nutrient') || modalText.includes('Basal') || modalText.includes('Urea') || modalText.includes('DAP');\nconst hasPests = modalText.includes('Pest') || modalText.includes('Disease') || modalText.includes('Warning') || modalText.includes('Rust') || modalText.includes('Alert');\n\n// Close modal\nconst closeBtn = page.getByRole('button', { name: /Close|✕|×/i }).first();\nif (await closeBtn.isVisible()) {\n  await closeBtn.click();\n} else {\n  await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n}\n\nreturn {\n  task2Screenshot: 'task2_crop_recommender.png',\n  task3Screenshot: 'task3_farming_plan_modal.png',\n  modalVerification: {\n    hasTimeline,\n    hasFertilizer,\n    hasPests,\n    snippet: modalText.slice(0, 300)\n  },\n  imgCount: imgStatus.length\n};"}}]}
